    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nekomin</strong> is a cute and relaxing puzzle action game where you use a cat toy to guide adorable kittens into a hole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles with items and tricks within the time limit to lead many kittens efficiently. Or, enjoy watching them while planning your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sneaky <strong>thief cats</strong> on the stage and complete your <strong>Neko List Collection</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/30919a945d95a4489764a5ea3b052a8d.poster.avif?t=1751938402\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/30919a945d95a4489764a5ea3b052a8d.webm?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/30919a945d95a4489764a5ea3b052a8d.mp4?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various items and tricks to solve puzzles and efficiently guide as many kittens as possible into the hole within the time limit. You can also take your time watching the adorable kittens while planning the best route for your cat toy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sneaky <strong>thief cats</strong> that appear on the stage and complete your <strong>Neko List Collection</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, look around and find the hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate <strong>Cat Toy Mode</strong> near the kittens to attract them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the kitten types displayed at the top of the screen and use the cat toy to guide matching kittens into the hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time limit only decreases in <strong>Cat Toy Mode</strong>, so you can take your time planning the best route.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/b4720a7a299d19ddb08508a0075be757.poster.avif?t=1751938402\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/b4720a7a299d19ddb08508a0075be757.webm?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/b4720a7a299d19ddb08508a0075be757.mp4?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the kittens into the hole within the time limit to clear the stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching kitten patterns and guiding them in together creates a <strong>combo</strong>, adding extra time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve different stage gimmicks to help kittens reach the hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special kittens like <strong>Can Cat</strong> and <strong>Thief Cat</strong> give you items or collection photos when guided into the hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your <strong>Neko List</strong> to view collected kitten photos\u2014try to collect them all!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/9a0139cf851c41162bdc7496f08a80a9.poster.avif?t=1751938402\" width=726 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/9a0139cf851c41162bdc7496f08a80a9.webm?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/9a0139cf851c41162bdc7496f08a80a9.mp4?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this <strong>relaxing puzzle game</strong> and have fun collecting adorable kittens! \ud83d\udc31\ud83d\udc95</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nekomin</strong> is a cute and relaxing puzzle action game where you use a cat toy to guide adorable kittens into a hole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles with items and tricks within the time limit to lead many kittens efficiently. Or, enjoy watching them while planning your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sneaky <strong>thief cats</strong> on the stage and complete your <strong>Neko List Collection</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/30919a945d95a4489764a5ea3b052a8d.poster.avif?t=1751938402\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/30919a945d95a4489764a5ea3b052a8d.webm?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/30919a945d95a4489764a5ea3b052a8d.mp4?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various items and tricks to solve puzzles and efficiently guide as many kittens as possible into the hole within the time limit. You can also take your time watching the adorable kittens while planning the best route for your cat toy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sneaky <strong>thief cats</strong> that appear on the stage and complete your <strong>Neko List Collection</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, look around and find the hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate <strong>Cat Toy Mode</strong> near the kittens to attract them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the kitten types displayed at the top of the screen and use the cat toy to guide matching kittens into the hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time limit only decreases in <strong>Cat Toy Mode</strong>, so you can take your time planning the best route.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/b4720a7a299d19ddb08508a0075be757.poster.avif?t=1751938402\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/b4720a7a299d19ddb08508a0075be757.webm?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/b4720a7a299d19ddb08508a0075be757.mp4?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the kittens into the hole within the time limit to clear the stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching kitten patterns and guiding them in together creates a <strong>combo</strong>, adding extra time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve different stage gimmicks to help kittens reach the hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special kittens like <strong>Can Cat</strong> and <strong>Thief Cat</strong> give you items or collection photos when guided into the hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your <strong>Neko List</strong> to view collected kitten photos\u2014try to collect them all!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/9a0139cf851c41162bdc7496f08a80a9.poster.avif?t=1751938402\" width=726 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/9a0139cf851c41162bdc7496f08a80a9.webm?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591720/extras/9a0139cf851c41162bdc7496f08a80a9.mp4?t=1751938402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this <strong>relaxing puzzle game</strong> and have fun collecting adorable kittens! \ud83d\udc31\ud83d\udc95</p>",
